        # from the VC++ redistributable.  Until 2026-11-05 this manifest also
        # declared Microsoft.VC90.CRT, which no binary imported any more; on a
        # machine without the VS2008 redist that dependency alone would keep
        # soffice.exe from starting (side-by-side configuration error; not
        # reproduced, the dev machines all have the redist).
        # The same manifest serves --compilation_mode=dbg, whose /MDd binaries
